      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>In this mode, the ranging is performed with all available responders in open mode. If a responder does not allow open mode ranging, the responder will be skipped from the ranging request.</para>
          <para>Note: If ScanResult.isRangingFrameProtectionRequired() is true, then open mode ranging is not supported by the AP.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/net/wifi/rtt/RangingRequest#SECURITY_MODE_OPEN" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.net.wifi.rtt.RangingRequest.SECURITY_MODE_OPEN</code>.</a></format></para>
